{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object not reached, take and check it, otherwise move to visible object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToVisibleObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
